+# EXEC0148 — original stock fresh-reset bank-aware 15-stage event chronology
+
+2026-11-10. Same inherited 1280×720 native C11 application and controller routes, version `1.48.0-dev1`; **NOT a finished original NES first Spring, Windows build or full campaign**.
+
+Actual code: `gk148_fresh_bank_trace.c/.h`, `test_gk148_fresh_bank_trace.c` linked into the existing `Gk1App`. The digest-gated 480-byte PRIVATE Mesen observation receipt has fifteen pre-existing original STOCK (not modified) samples: boot through playable command-menu snapshot. WorkRAM and SaveRAM are distinguished; a fresh-reset sample must have the 14 original countries in **nesWorkRam** after setup. The record identifies setup appearance, food doubling, spring year+rate, later finance, and eventual 3 orders at distinct CPU-cycle/frame boundaries. This is source-observed chronology, not an original source RNG instruction timeline, a formula, game state generator or an algorithm to advance seasons. The original licensed records, private `.mss`, ROM and snapshots are **excluded** from public source.
+
+Test: `cmake -S execution_148 -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release && cmake --build build -j8 && ctest --test-dir build -j8 --output-on-failure`. Public refusal and synthetic checks `build/test_gk148_fresh_bank_trace` cannot claim Mesen authenticity. Private positive: `build/test_gk148_fresh_bank_trace execution_049/GK1_ALL_41_COUNTRY_ECONOMIC_DATA_v1.07.csv <owner-private-exact-480B-timeline>`; the attested original fresh WorkRAM timeline is SHA256 `5c05be5be2adee96d31f3d18c5ce7c9b510c1ef5c86670f6250ac1594d5400db` and is **never distributed**. The original fresh 14-country 83-byte records separately carry original SHA256 `04eb853683a3dada2a6a127baf61b6be2332114213cedc9e295c183647c6c73e`.
+
+Reported observed moments (these are **sample indices**, not causal source routine boundaries): first 14 countries sample 02, setup food change sample 09, year1175 and first nonzero Rate sample 10, financial change sample 12, initial 3 orders sample 14. Stage 14 observed Gold430 Food208 Troops61 Rate121 under this particular original RNG history, **not universal initial values**; the distinct archived original Spring Gold439/Rate101 and World1206 Gold193/Rate114 remain separate. The source API cannot alter the game phase, original country records, three orders or Enhanced mutable state. It rejects malformed/modified timeline files, wrong-bank observations and impossible chronologies atomically.
+
+**VERIFIED_STATIC:** SHA-gated event replay, source integration and controlled negative cases. **OBSERVED_RUNTIME_STOCK_FRESH_RESET:** inherited Mesen event capture, no new Mesen run. **TESTED_PORT_LINUX:** Release/Debug tests and GUI/DEB tests when reported by run QA. **NOT RUN:** new original NES emulator gameplay, independently generated original Spring, stock merchant RNG, full AI/diplomacy/dynasty/battle terminal, complete Win32/NSIS and physical Xbox campaigns.
